    "title": "Fort Dix cleared after FPCON Charlie incident March 17",
    "text": "CRIMEFort Dix goes on high alert for 'suspicious' packages, no threat found Kaitlyn McCormickCherry Hill Courier-PostUpdated March 17, 2026, 5:25 p.m. ETKeep WatchingJoint Base McGuire-Dix-Lakehurst issued a security alert the afternoon of March 17 after officials said \"suspicious packages\" were found on the Burlington County military base.At approximately 3:32 p.m., Joint Base MDL shared via social media that the base was in \"FPCON Charlie,\" employing increased security measures. FPCON Charlie is one of the five Force Protection Condition levels used on U.S. military bases and government buildings, indicating some form of terroristic threat or action targeting either a facility or personnel according to the U.S. Defense Logistics Agency.An hour later at 4:34 p.m., base officials announced that gates had reopened and that the packages were determined to have posed \"no threat.\"More: Did Senate pass SAVE Act? What documents would you need to vote in NJ?\"We are grateful for the quick and professional actions of our first responders whose vigilance keep our community safe every day,\" the statement read.Kaitlyn McCormick writes about politics, education and trending news across South Jersey for the Courier-Post, The Daily Journal and the Burlington County Times. If you have a story she should tell, email her at kmccormick@usatodayco.com. And subscribe to stay up to date on the news you need.Your Refund is Calling! IRS E-File is OpenTurboTax | AdAdLearn MoreUndoWe’re Open! Get Your Taxes Done TodayTurboTax | AdAdLearn MoreUndoOn this island, none of this treasure is buriedAtlantis Paradise Island | AdAdBook NowUndoProtect Yourself from Fake Toll Scams!How to detect this devious smishing scam and outsmart cybercriminals at their own gameAAA | AdAdUndoStay Safe & Cozy: Top 5 Hotel Hacks!From outsmarting bed bugs to thwarting thieves, these simple yet brilliant hacks will help you rest easier during your next hotel stayAAA | AdAdUndoSearch For Cash Flow 